\centering
\caption{Multi-layer instruction-dominant attention heads and text attention fraction across three conditions. VLA fine-tuning produces a bookend pattern (L1 + L31); Llama-2 base peaks at L16 (inverted-U); untrained shows no instruction routing at any layer.}
\label{tab:multilayer_attention}
